@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Seed Database (Recreate Index & Ingest 40 Products)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/seed
Accept: application/json

### 3. Relevance Search: "dell notebook" (Boosted name & brand over description)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/search?q=dell%20notebook
Accept: application/json

### 4. Accent-Insensitive Search: "cafeteira eletrica" (Matches "Cafeteira Elétrica Oster")
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/search?q=cafeteira%20eletrica
Accept: application/json

### 5. Typo-Tolerant Search (Fuzzy): "del notebok"
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/search?q=del%20notebok&fuzzy=true
Accept: application/json

### 6. Exact Phrase Match: "smart tv"
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/search?q=smart%20tv&phrase=true
Accept: application/json

### 7. Filtered Search (Computers category between $3,000 and $8,000)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/search?category=Computers&minPrice=3000&maxPrice=8000
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Product by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 9. Faceted Aggregations (Categories, Brands, Price Stats)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/aggregations
Accept: application/json

### 10. Diagnostics: Analyze with Custom products_analyzer (Asciifolding active)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/search/analyze?text=Cafeteira%20El%C3%A9trica&analyzer=products_analyzer
Accept: application/json

### 11. Diagnostics: Analyze with standard analyzer (Accents preserved)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/search/analyze?text=Cafeteira%20El%C3%A9trica&analyzer=standard
Accept: application/json
